{"id":"n5-016","title":"い-Adjective: Negative Polite Form","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Change an い-adjective into a polite negative form with ～くないです (or ～くありません).","longExplanation":"To make an い-adjective negative and polite, remove the final い and add くないです. An alternative more formal style is くありません. For example, 美味しい → 美味しくないです / 美味しくありません。","formation":"い-Adjective (remove い, add く) + ないです / ありません","examples":[{"jp":"このピザは美味しくないです。","romaji":"Kono piza wa oishiku nai desu.","en":"This pizza is not delicious.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ピザ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味しく","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしい","baseForm":"美味しい"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"この部屋は広くないです。","romaji":"Kono heya wa hiroku nai desu.","en":"This room is not spacious.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"部屋","vocabId":"1499320","reading":"へや"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"広く","vocabId":"1278410","reading":"ひろい","baseForm":"広い"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"彼の意見は面白くないです。","romaji":"Kare no iken wa omoshiroku nai desu.","en":"His opinion is not interesting.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"意見","vocabId":"1156530","reading":"いけん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"面白く","vocabId":"1533580","reading":"おもしろい","baseForm":"面白い"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"その映画は楽しくありません。","romaji":"Sono eiga wa tanoshiku arimasen.","en":"That movie is not enjoyable.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"楽しく","vocabId":"1207240","reading":"たのしい","baseForm":"楽しい"},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]}]}